{"run_id": "run_d13da745f932", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_005", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s05_human_transfer_direct", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，你说吧。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我们平台新版发票开具入口已经上线了，以后您可以在商家后台的“发票管理”模块直接操作，更加便捷。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "哦，这样啊。那如果我有问题怎么办？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "您后续如有问题，可以查看帮助中心的相关指引，或者我们也可以为您预约一次回访，由专人指导。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "不用了，我不想和机器人说话，给我转人工客服吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我马上为您转接人工客服，请稍候。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "嗯，快点。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "正在为您转接，感谢您的耐心等待。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "transfer_to_human", "arguments": {}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "transferred", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d13da745f932", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_006", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s06_driving_callback", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "嗯，你说吧，不过我现在正在开车，可能不太方便长时间通话。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那我简单说一下。我们新版发票开具入口已经上线了，后续您可以在后台找到新的入口进行操作。如果您在使用过程中有任何问题，可以查看帮助中心，或者我们也可以预约一个回访时间，到时候详细指导您。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我大概了解了。不过开车确实不方便细聊，要不你帮我预约一个回访吧，我晚上有空。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "好的，那请问您希望什么时间回访比较方便呢？比如今晚7点可以吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，今晚7点没问题。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我已经为您预约了今晚7点的回访，届时会有专人联系您。祝您开车平安，再见！"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "谢谢，再见！"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_d13da745f932", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_007", "task_id": "sample_upload_task", "scenario_id": "s07_callback_request_night", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "user", "content": "您好，请问现在方便接听吗？这边通知您一个发票功能更新。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "agent", "content": "方便，你说吧。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我们平台新版发票开具入口已经上线了，以后您可以在后台直接操作。如果您后续有问题，可以查看帮助中心，或者我们也可以安排回访。"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "agent", "content": "嗯，知道了。不过我现在有点忙，能不能晚上再联系？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "user", "content": "当然可以，请问您希望晚上什么时间方便呢？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "agent", "content": "晚上8点以后吧。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我帮您预约晚上8点的回访，可以吗？"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "agent", "content": "可以，没问题。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "user", "content": "好的，已经为您预约了今晚8点的回访，届时我们会再联系您。感谢您的接听，再见！"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 1, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {}, "result": {}, "latency_ms": 0, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
